        "excerpts": [
          "“I’m pretty excited about that,” Shelton said when he was told how many aces he hit. “We came into this indoor swing talking about spot serving. We changed my serve, the technique. To come out here in the first match and serve the way that I did, I’m very pleased with that. This is how you win on fast indoor courts.”",
